'''Celeboodle''' (セレブ, ''Serebu'', '''Celeb''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[The Aku Realms]], and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. She was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

