==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Celeboodle
|Sunny Celeboodle
|Celeboodle takes her [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|summer]] vacation! She has much higher HP as well as Area Attack and longer range. The downside of these buffs are that she has lower base damage and usually spawns alone.
|Mistress Celeboodle
|An [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of Celeboodle. She has a higher money drop and deals much more damage, while strengthening by 100% at 75% health.
|Selena
|Sunny Celeboodle's [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant. She attacks quicker and is considerably stronger, with [[knockback]] and [[slow]] abilities, but has much shorter range.
|Devil Wife
|An [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of Celeboodle. She has slightly higher stats, but is often buffed. While remaining single-target, she always generates a Lv.1 [[Surge Attack]] upon death as a psuedo-Area Attack which can wipe out those not [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|immune]].
}}

